      "title": "Career Bridge",
      "description": "National Louis University | Chicago, Illinois | Tampa, Florida Cookie Policy We use cookies to make our site work better for you, remember your preferences, and understand how people use\r\n            our site. By clicking \"Accept\" , you help us improve your experience. Accept Decline Skip navigation Search Search: Go Menu Toggle navigation Degree Programs Academics Open subnavigation Back to Main Menu Colleges Degree Programs Licensures and Endorsements Locations Florida Campus Course Catalog Course Schedule Academic Calendar Corporate Education Admissions Open subnavigation Back to Main Menu Undergraduate Admissions Graduate Admissions Transfer Admissions Transfer Credit and Agreements Credit for Prior Learning Returning Student Process Military and Veterans International Registration Attend a Virtual Info Session Tuition and Aid Open subnavigation Back to Main Menu Tuition and Fees Types of Aid How to Apply for Aid Student Aid FAQs Net Price Calculator Scholarships Military and Veterans Benefits Office of Student Finance Student Finance FAQs Payment Options Student Employment One Big Beautiful Bill Act Information Student Experience Open subnavigation Back to Main Menu Career Services Student Affairs Student Advising Learning Support Registrar Library Military and Veteran Students International Students Faces of NLU Commencement Campus Safety Campus Tours Student Complaints & Grievances Let Us Know News and Events Open subnavigation Back to Main Menu News Events Blog Media Center Eagle Talk Podcast 140th Anniversary About Open subnavigation Back to Main Menu History President Leadership Mission and Values NLU at a Glance Accreditation Locations Contact and Campus Hours NLU Store Job Opportunities Giving 2030 Strategic Plan Faculty Directory Campus Tours Consumer Information University Center Partnerships FAQs Emergencies Alerts Locations On-Campus and Online (888) 658-8632 Students Alumni Faculty and Staff Request Info Apply Give Career Bridge Home / Student Services / Career Bridge Quick Links Meet the Team Job Portal Career Advising FAQs Career Tools Undergraduate Internship FAQs International Employers Alumni Everything we do lays the groundwork for a career. Higher education should inspire and accelerate the next step of a student’s career. Career Bridge is designed to foster meaningful connections between students, alumni and employers, sparking opportunity and making career preparation seamless. For students, more career-launching opportunities. For many of our students, a college degree needs to be nothing less than a springboard for professional advancement. Our Career Bridge department ensures that every graduate leaves NLU with practical, real-world experience and valuable connections in their industry. Search for jobs or internships Meet with a Career Advisor For employers, a diverse pool of ambitious talent. Our Career Bridge Employer Relations Team partners with organizations to provide recruiting opportunities with thousands of NLU students and alumni, often at no cost to the organization. We take care of the logistics so you can meet your hiring, intern and extern needs with motivated, career-focused candidates. Partner with NLU A step-by-step bridge to the next phase of your career. The prospect of planning your career while juggling the responsibilities of school, work and life can be daunting. Career Bridge provides resources such as career advising, résumé reviews, internships, externships and networking events to make it a manageable, continuous process: 1 EXPLORE Begin building your brand, researching career paths and meeting employers. 2 PREPARE Create marketing materials (résumé, cover letters, etc.). 3 PRACTICE Complete career-based service project and attend networking events. 4 LAUNCH Begin internship or externship and apply for grad school or employment opportunities. A toolbox of career-advancing resources. HANDSHAKE: A one-stop shop that connects employers seeking talent and students seeking jobs. SUCCESS COACHES: From day one until graduation, every student works with a counselor dedicated to helping them succeed. BRAVEN CAREER ACCELERATOR: Students have the opportunity to participate in this nationally recognized career-launching program. Locations, Hours and Contact Info Career Bridge has offices in three locations, but we’re able to assist students and alumni no matter where they are located. Email or call to make an in-person or virtual appointment with a Career Advisor. 122 S. Michigan Ave. Chicago, IL 60603 18 S. Michigan Ave. Chicago, IL 60603 1000 Capitol Dr. Wheeling, IL 60090 Open Monday–Friday, 9am to 5pm CST. Appointment times may vary. CareerBridge@nl.edu 312.261.3270 Career Bridge YouTube Channel Your next step is within reach. With over 135 years of excellence and 70,000 alumni, we have the resources and experience to take your career to the next level. Request Info Attend a Virtual Session Apply Now National Louis University Illinois Admissions Registration Tuition & Aid P.A.C.E. at NLU Corporate Education Alumni Transcript Requests Florida Admissions Registration Tuition & Aid Corporate Education Alumni Transcript Requests Contact us Careers at NLU FAQs Inspire tomorrow’s difference-makers by equipping them with a world-class education today! Give today! © 2026 National Louis University twitter facebook instagram youtube"
