Give Home / Employment Employment Menu Career Opportunities Benefits Training & Development Applicant Help Adjunct Applicant Process At National Louis University, your work matters. We go beyond teaching to transform lives—grounded in innovation, access, excellence, and equity. Our culture of service excellence means we show up as collaborative, accountable, responsive, empathetic, and solution-oriented colleagues, committed to making every interaction thoughtful, inclusive, and respectful.\n\nWhether you join us as faculty, staff, or adjunct, you’ll be part of a mission-driven community where ideas are valued, student success comes first, and your contributions make a tangible difference. Together, we create a welcoming and supportive environment that empowers students through access to higher education and gives you the opportunity to do meaningful, impactful work every day. Come be part of a place where your purpose meets possibility. National Louis University is an Equal Access/Equal Opportunity Employer dedicated to the achievement of excellence among its students, faculty and staff. NLU is committed to fostering an inclusive community where everyone feels a sense of belonging and strongly encourages all qualified individuals to apply. NLU is committed to positioning and maintaining its facilities in convenient, safe locations and creating policies and safety procedures to ensure that the possibility of criminal offense is diminished, and public safety is enhanced. In accordance with the Jeanne Clery Disclosure of Campus Security Policy and Campus Crime Statistics Act of 1998, prospective employees may request a copy of the University's Annual Safety Report by contacting the Facilities Office at each of our locations or by downloading the report: Annual Security and Fire Safety & CLERY Report 2025 Tweets by @nlujobs Your Next Step is Within Reach. With over 140 years of excellence and 100,000 alumni, we provide an extraordinary education that’s within your reach. Request Info Attend an Event Apply Now National Louis University Illinois Admissions Registration Tuition & Aid P.A.C.E. at NLU Corporate Education Alumni Transcript Requests Florida Admissions Registration Tuition & Aid Corporate Education Alumni Transcript Requests Contact us Careers at NLU FAQs Inspire tomorrow’s difference-makers by equipping them with a world-class education today! Give today! © 2026 National Louis University twitter facebook instagram youtube"
